OL,3,GNEWSAPort operator withdraws vehicle
OL,4,Aterminal plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA port operator has withdrawn plans for
OL,7,Fa new vehicle terminal that would
OL,8,Fexpand the Port of Southampton.
OL,10,FAssociated British Ports (ABP) has
OL,11,Fwithdrawn its Solent Gateway 2 project
OL,12,Ffrom the Planning Inspectorate's
OL,13,Fdevelopment consent process but said it
OL,14,Fstill hopes to develop the scheme in
OL,15,Fthe future.
OL,17,FThe proposed Dibden Bay development
OL,18,Fincluded a two-berth jetty for roll-on,
OL,19,Froll-off vehicle cargo, terminal space
OL,20,Fand a new access road connecting the
OL,21,Fsite to the A326.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
