OL,3,GNEWSAPort operator withdraws vehicle
OL,4,Aterminal plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move comes as ABP said it would
OL,7,Flook instead at creating more space in
OL,8,FSouthampton and at the existing Solent
OL,9,FGateway at Marchwood.
